  "sourceTitle": "Shortcake Protein De Lite",
  "sourceText": "Shortcake Protein De Lite\nBy: Adam Paul Green\nPublished: Wednesday, July 18, 2012 - 1:25pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 chunk dark chocolate (Xocai Protein Bar)\n1/3 slice bananas\n4 slices strawberries\n10 whole blueberries\n4 tbsps non-fat whipped topping\n1 oz dark chocolate (Xocai Activ liquid)\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Remove Protein Bar from wrapper. Place in bowl and microwave for 8 seconds to warm. Top with fruit. Place whipping cream over the top and drizzle with Activ. Serves 1",
